            ns2:ExternalRefType ;
        rdfs:label "sourceArtifact" ;
        rdfs:comment "A reference to an artifact containing the sources for a package."@en .

    <https://spdx.org/rdf/3.0/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/staticAnalysisReport> a owl:NamedIndividual,
